---
// A brief, personal closing — not the heavier dual-path ClosingCta used on
// the homepage (that component is built specifically around the Real
// Estate booking split, which doesn't apply here). Two quiet links, not a
// sales push.
---

<section class="section section--dark surface-leather about-closing">
  <div class="container about-closing__inner">
    <p class="about-closing__copy">
      Thanks for taking the time to learn a bit about LENZ. If you'd like to see the work or
      talk through a project, either path below works.
    </p>
    <div class="about-closing__links">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/work/">Explore the Portfolio</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-on-dark" href="/contact/">Start a Project</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-closing__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .about-closing__copy {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-offwhite);
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-closing__links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }
</style>
